  m_Name: Mail_002_TrueManifest
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameLogic.Data.MailData
  emailId: mail_002_true_manifest
  unlockDay: 1
  sender: UNKNOWN
  subject: THE TRUE MANIFEST
  body: "<b>I</b>\nAll things arise from the True Manifest. What comes to pass has a reason, or has none, and either way it is true. Truth is seeing into. Truth is waking. Truth is the knowing that the Manifest stands without reason and without meaning. So the newborn duckling follows its mother and asks nothing of her, though she lead it to its end. Believe only that the thing is true and plainly manifest, and nothing else can twist it, change it, or turn it from its course.\n\n<b>II</b>\nThe True Manifest is without end. It has no border, and it cannot depart from the source of the infinite. Once it is born it endures forever, unchanged, and it cannot be changed. So it is with fate. Strive as a man may, fate has drawn the story and set the bounds of its law, as an author\u2019s pen draws lines, and it stands as it was written. It cannot be turned from what is true, for the True Manifest is as the first beginning, and lasts as long as eternity lasts.\n\n<b>III</b>\nWe ourselves are the proof of the True Manifest. A self that overflows with awareness takes its birth from the truth made plain. The soul, the essence of surpassing wisdom, grows into a being full of consciousness. And only such beings may perceive the truth made plain, before they turn again to the beginning, for all time.\n\n<b>IV</b>\nThough we be without reason, without meaning, to the truth that rests above the depths of thought, the truth that appears is still the True Manifest, plain beneath awareness and conscience. It asks no other meaning of us, and no reason by the law of the seven worlds. It is enough to hold as manifest whatever the conscience holds to be so. There is no cause to doubt, and none to wonder. Such is thought born of wisdom and filled with awareness.\n\n<b>V</b>\nThe True Manifest has no self, no body, no logic by the law of the seven worlds, and no freedom. Yet it holds a power like divine decree spoken from the mouth of God. It shines clear and bright, and leads common people to live by its law, walking the road of a story already written. This is fate, and it cannot be changed. Only the one who speaks the True Manifest may change the truth made plain."
  attachment: {fileID: 0}
